# Suppressions for rubik.
# Keep this file EMPTY of real suppressions unless you have a proven reason —
# a leak you suppressed is a leak you still have at defense.
#
# Only the mandatory binary is graded under valgrind, and it links no graphics
# code, so nothing from Mesa/X11 should ever need suppressing here.
#
# Template, in case you ever need one:
#
# {
#    name_of_suppression
#    Memcheck:Leak
#    fun:malloc
#    fun:some_library_function
# }
